return {
    ["%s超越了%d%%的非凡者，精准的收割，优雅的杀戮。"] = "%s surpassed %d%% of Beyonders. Precise harvesting, elegant slaughter.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>铁路大亨</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-城堡\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在铁路大亨-困难线路中单局达成“铁路大亨-1阶”"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Railway Tycoon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure - May Manor · Castle\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Achieve \"Railway Tycoon - Tier 1\" in a single round of Railway Tycoon - Hard Route",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>羊毛混纺・洁白内衬・户外短装\n阳光在晨起时就打了照面，晴朗的一天从现在开始。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Wool Blend - White Lining - Outdoor Short Outfit\nThe sun greets you at dawn; a bright day begins now.",
    ["<Highlight>封印物</>：你正在使用的封印物，本质上是由某位神秘的“奇迹师”所召唤的历史投影。这种历史投影相较于原版封印物，能力有所弱化，但负面效果也有所减轻，能为非凡者带来各种提升。\n其中，普通封印物分为攻击、防御、特化三种，每类封印物最多携带一件使用；特殊封印物为非凡者提供各种特殊能力，不直接提升非凡者战力。\n<Highlight>封印物等级</>：普通封印物初始均为“3”级，扮演等级达到46级后可以消耗“历史回响”将封印物提升到“2”级。“3”级封印物最多可生效4条非凡物质词条效果，“2”级封印物最多可生效5条非凡物质词条效果。\n<Highlight>非凡物质</>：扮演等级达到42级时，可解锁非凡物质填充。为封印物填充不同的非凡物质，能为封印物附加上各种额外的效果。\n<Highlight>非凡共鸣</>：封印物填充非凡物质时，根据非凡物质的词条数量，生效额外的非凡效果，封印物等级提升，会提高非凡共鸣所能生效的最大词条数量。\n<Highlight>非凡知识</>：提升非凡知识等级，能使你更好地掌控非凡之力，封印物非凡能力效果、非凡物质固定属性值与非凡共鸣属性值会随非凡知识等级提升。\n<Highlight>聚合</>：扮演等级达到47级时，可解锁非凡物质聚合。将两个金色品质的非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质，可能获得更多词条的非凡物质。"] = "<Highlight> Sealed Artifact </>: The Sealed Artifact you are currently using is essentially a historical projection summoned by a mysterious \"Miracle Invoker.\" Compared to the original Sealed Artifact, this historical projection has weakened abilities, but its negative effects are also reduced, and it can bring various improvements to the Beyonder. \n Among them, ordinary Sealed Artifacts are divided into Attack, Defense, and Specialized types, with a maximum of one of each type being carried for use; Special Sealed Artifacts provide Beyonders with various special abilities and do not directly increase the Beyonder's combat power. \n <Highlight> Sealed Artifact Level </>: Ordinary Sealed Artifacts are all initially Level 3. After reaching Acting Level 46, you can consume \"Historical Echoes\" to upgrade the Sealed Artifact to Level 2. A Level 3 Sealed Artifact can have up to 4 Beyonder material affix effects active, while a Level 2 Sealed Artifact can have up to 5 Beyonder material affix effects active. \n <Highlight> Beyonder Material </>: When your Acting Level reaches 42, you can unlock Beyonder material filling. Filling the Sealed Artifact with different Beyonder materials can attach various additional effects to it. \n <Highlight> Beyonder Resonance </>: When a Sealed Artifact is filled with Beyonder materials, additional Beyonder effects take effect based on the number of affixes on the Beyonder materials. Increasing the Sealed Artifact level will increase the maximum number of affixes that can be effective for Beyonder Resonance. \n <Highlight> Beyonder Knowledge </>: Increasing your Beyonder Knowledge level allows you to better control Beyonder powers. The effects of the Sealed Artifact's Beyonder abilities, the fixed attribute values of Beyonder materials, and the Beyonder Resonance attribute values will all increase with the Beyonder Knowledge level. \n <Highlight> Aggregation </>: When your Acting Level reaches 47, you can unlock Beyonder material aggregation. Aggregating two gold-quality Beyonder materials into a new Beyonder material may result in a Beyonder material with more affixes.",
    ["<Highlight>工坊生产</>\n玩家可以通过<Highlight>指派雇员</>到工坊，来生产物产。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1、雇员生产速度</>\n指派雇员<Highlight>数量越多</>，生产速度越快；指派雇员<Highlight>稀有度越高</>，生产速度越快。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2、提升生产速度</>\n<Highlight>升级秘偶等级</>后，会<Highlight>提升生产速度</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3、生产速度上限</>\n每个工坊存在<Highlight>生产速度上限</>，达到上限后继续指派雇员不会提升生产速度。"] = "<Highlight>Workshop Production</>\nPlayers can produce products by <Highlight>assigning employees</> to the workshop. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1. Employee production speed </>\nThe more <Highlight>employees assigned</>, the faster the production speed; the higher the <Highlight>rarity of the assigned employees</>, the faster the production speed. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2. Increase production speed </>\n<Highlight>Upgrading the marionette level</> will <Highlight>increase production speed</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3. Production speed limit </>\nEach workshop has a <Highlight>production speed limit</>. After reaching the limit, assigning more employees will not increase the production speed.",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意尖声说话）</>要是有人能在这危急关头献上50块小鱼干，日后就是廷根市长！"] = "<P_Heart> (deliberately speaking in a high-pitched voice) </> If anyone can offer 50 dried fish at this critical moment, they will be the Mayor of Tingen in the future!",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹息）</>，我理解有时约定会变成枷锁，但请再三思，{{先生|女士}}。单方解契会在你们之间留下裂痕，这真的是你想要的结果吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </>, I understand that sometimes promises can become shackles, but please think twice, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. Unilateral termination of the covenant will leave a rift between you. Is this really the result you want?",
